{
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><title>About JBrowser</title><style>:root { --primary: #6366f1; --primary-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4); --bg-dark: #0f172a; --bg-darker: #020617; --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); --text-main: #f8fafc; --text-muted: #94a3b8; } body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #1e1b4b, var(--bg-darker) 60%); color: var(--text-main); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; justify-content: center; } .container { width: 90%; max-width: 1000px; margin: 4rem 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem; } .glass-panel { background: var(--glass); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 24px; padding: 3rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); } header { text-align: center; position: relative; } .logo { width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 25%; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--primary-glow); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); } h1 { font-size: 3rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0e7ff, #818cf8); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; } .subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 300; margin: 0 0 2rem 0; } .hero-image { width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 350px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); } .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; } .feature-card { background: var(--glass); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem; transition: transform 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease; } .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); } .icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); color: #818cf8; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; } .feature-card h3 { margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 1.3rem; color: #e2e8f0; } .feature-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; } .feature-full { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; justify-content: space-between; } .feature-image { max-width: 250px; width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); } @media(max-width: 768px) { .feature-full { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; } .feature-image { max-width: 100%; margin-top: 1.5rem; } } footer { text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1rem; }</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><header class=\"glass-panel\"><img src=\"media_1\" alt=\"JBrowser Logo\" class=\"logo\" /><h1>JBrowser</h1><p class=\"subtitle\">The premium browsing experience, engineered for Android.</p><img src=\"media_2\" alt=\"JBrowser Interface Preview\" class=\"hero-image\" /></header><main class=\"features-grid\"><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><path d=\"M9 9l6 6M15 9l-6 6\"/></svg></div><h3>Built-in Adblocking</h3><p>Browse faster and cleaner. Our native engine stops trackers, pop-ups, and intrusive ads dead in their tracks before they load.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg></div><h3>Premium VPN</h3><p>Bank-grade encryption meets blazing speeds. Secure your data on public Wi-Fi and access global content effortlessly.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3>Video Download &amp; Detection</h3><p>Smart stream-sniffing technology detects embedded videos on any page, letting you download in HD for offline viewing with a single tap.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"icon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"7\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"21\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"21\"/></svg></div><h3>Tab Management</h3><p>Master your multitasking. Group tabs, sleep inactive ones to save RAM, and swipe seamlessly through an elegant interface.</p></div><div class=\"feature-card feature-full\"><div><h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">Sleek Dark Mode</h3><p>Gorgeous AMOLED-friendly dark mode that saves battery and protects your eyes. Every UI element is meticulously styled for the perfect nighttime browsing experience.</p></div><img src=\"media_3\" alt=\"Dark Mode Feature\" class=\"feature-image\" /></div></main><footer>&copy; 2026 JBrowser Technologies. All rights reserved.</footer></div></body></html>",
